Description:
    Install wulin_agent in a Wulin Master host application.

Example:
    rails generate wulin_agent:install

    This will:
        create  config/initializers/wulin_agent.rb
        insert  wulin_agent asset links in manifest.js, application.js, application.css
        (optional) add #wulin-agent-root to host layout if present

    Then run:
        rails db:migrate
        export OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-...
        rake wulin_permits:load_permission